# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# Example: notes(html): add semantic tags reference
# Example: task(24-sep): implement rocket animation and responsive navbar
#
# Allowed types:
#   notes    : Class notes, theoretical explanations, cheatsheets
#   task     : Daily tasks, lab assignments, homework problems
#   feat     : New feature, interactive widget, or webpage
#   fix      : Bug fix in CSS layout, broken link, JS logic error
#   style    : CSS styling tweaks, formatting, animations (no logic change)
#   refactor : Code cleanup or reorganization without changing behavior
#   docs     : Updates to README, documentation, or comments
#
# Remember:
#   - Keep the summary line concise (under 50-72 chars)
#   - Use present tense ("add" not "added", "fix" not "fixed")
# -------------------------------------------------------------
